%% The 1. man take his wo. by the right-hand, then by the left, and so holding hands change places,
%% then do the same to the 2. wo. the 1. wo. and 2. man do the same :| Then fall back from your own,
%% the 1. cu. being in the 2. cu. place, go the Figure of 8 .| Do this to the last.
%%endtext
